---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="What We Believe">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>What We Believe</h1>
    <p>
      Our faith is grounded in the Word of God. Below you’ll find the core beliefs
      that shape who we are and what we do as a church family.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="beliefs">
    <article class="belief">
      <h2>About God</h2>
      <p>
        We believe in one Holy, triune God—eternal in three persons: The Father, The Son
        (Jesus Christ), and The Holy Spirit. Each is co-eternal, co-equal, and co-identical
        in nature, yet carrying distinct but harmonious roles in salvation.  
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        “Hear, O Israel: The LORD our God is one LORD.” <span>(Deut. 6:4)</span>
      </blockquote>
    </article>

    <article class="belief">
      <h2>About the Bible</h2>
      <p>
        We believe the Bible is the holy, infallible, preserved, and perfect Word of God—
        the only absolute authority for doctrine and living.  
      </p>
      <p>
        We hold to the King James Bible as the best preserved Word of God for English-speaking
        people, rejecting modern versions that introduce corruption and doctrinal error.  
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        “The words of the LORD are pure words...” <span>(Psalm 12:6–7)</span>
      </blockquote>
    </article>

    <article class="belief">
      <h2>About Salvation</h2>
      <p>
        Man is sinful by nature and cannot be saved by works. Salvation is the free gift of God,
        given by grace through faith in the death, burial, and resurrection of Jesus Christ.  
        Once saved, a believer is eternally secure in Christ.  
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        “For by grace are ye saved through faith...” <span>(Eph. 2:8–9)</span>
      </blockquote>
    </article>

    <article class="belief">
      <h2>About the Church</h2>
      <p>
        The church is both the body of Christ (all believers) and the local congregation of
        baptized believers. Jesus is its founder and head.  
      </p>
      <p>
        We believe in two ordinances: baptism and the Lord’s Supper—acts of obedience and
        remembrance, not salvation.  
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        “Go ye therefore, and teach all nations, baptizing them...” <span>(Matt. 28:19)</span>
      </blockquote>
    </article>

    <article class="belief">
      <h2>About Dispensation</h2>
      <p>
        We believe the Scriptures must be rightly divided, recognizing God’s dealings with
        mankind in different ages.  
      </p>
      <p>
        We reject teachings that bind the church under the Mosaic law, replace Israel, or
        place the church in the Tribulation.  
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        “Study to shew thyself approved unto God...” <span>(2 Tim. 2:15)</span>
      </blockquote>
    </article>

    <article class="belief">
      <h2>About Witnessing</h2>
      <p>
        We believe it is every Christian’s responsibility to share the Gospel and fulfill the
        Great Commission through soul-winning, missions, and personal testimony.  
      </p>
      <p>
        It is the Holy Spirit—not persuasion—that convicts and saves. We are simply called
        to faithfully proclaim Christ.  
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        “Go ye into all the world, and preach the gospel...” <span>(Mark 16:15)</span>
      </blockquote>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="closing">
    <p>
      These statements summarize what we believe the Bible clearly teaches. We encourage you
      to study the Scriptures and see these truths for yourself.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 1rem;
    background: var(--background-color);
    color: var(--primary-color);
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .hero p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .beliefs {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .belief {
    background: white;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }
  .belief h2 {
    color: var(--primary-color);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  blockquote {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-color);
    font-style: italic;
    color: #555;
  }
  blockquote span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--primary-color);
  }

  .closing {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 1rem;
    background: var(--primary-color);
    color: white;
  }
</style>
